#project("Scholastic Take-Private LBO | Financial Modeling", url: "https://github.com/faketut/schl-take-private-lbo")
- Built a three-scenario LBO model from SEC XBRL data, with \$919M sources and uses, a four-tranche debt stack, covenant sweep, dividend recap, and exit waterfall.
- Used Python-driven model rebuilds and tornado analysis to identify terminal EBITDA margin as the dominant return driver; recommended declining at \$47/share and rebidding at \$40–42.
